WEBVTT

00:00.540 --> 00:05.030
That transfer student Motoyasu
 got suspended again?

00:05.030 --> 00:07.430
He's a lot stranger
 than the teachers said.

00:07.430 --> 00:08.770
You've got that right.

00:08.770 --> 00:11.910
That big explosion, the pasta zombies...

00:11.910 --> 00:14.930
So much weird stuff is going on 
that my head hurts.

00:14.930 --> 00:20.710
And you think the transfer students
 in Class 1 might know something?

00:20.710 --> 00:22.480
Yup.

00:22.480 --> 00:25.510
I'm pretty sure Shadow is working 
with one of the Seven Shadows.

00:25.510 --> 00:28.670
Hopefully they'll be able
 to tell us something useful.

00:28.670 --> 00:31.620
But I don't see any of the Seven Shadows!

00:31.620 --> 00:33.790
So we wasted a trip, huh?

00:33.790 --> 00:34.600
Hm?

00:35.590 --> 00:36.730
Neumann?

00:36.730 --> 00:40.180
I didn't know he had a friend in another class.

00:40.180 --> 00:43.300
Actually, was there anyone like that...

00:44.030 --> 00:45.950
... in our school at all?

00:52.240 --> 00:59.860
ISEKAI QUARTET 3

02:13.530 --> 02:16.980
ISEKAI QUARTET 3

02:16.990 --> 02:21.970
Episode 6: Search! Shadow and Devil

02:17.730 --> 02:20.070
And so that guy, Cid Kagenou,

02:20.070 --> 02:26.110
ended up in this world even though 
he has no powers and no magic.

02:27.630 --> 02:33.670
I can understand someone who can't 
fight wanting to live quietly.

02:33.670 --> 02:38.690
This world is filled with monsters 
that are just as scary as you!

02:38.690 --> 02:41.590
Wait, Visha, what does that mean?

02:44.390 --> 02:46.060
By the way...

02:46.060 --> 02:50.210
Why are you all enjoying 
a massive picnic out here?

02:50.210 --> 02:56.100
Well, Rem and Naofumi made us lunch.

02:56.100 --> 02:58.320
This is pretty good.

02:58.320 --> 02:59.900
Is mayonnaise the secret ingredient?

02:59.900 --> 03:01.270
That's right.

03:01.270 --> 03:04.960
And you've sliced these mini-hot dogs
just perfectly, Naofumi-san!

03:05.750 --> 03:07.920
I had them make yours the same as mine!

03:06.580 --> 03:10.950
Tanya, you can talk about this 
stuff after lunch, right?

03:07.920 --> 03:10.210
Try it, Beatrice-chan!

03:10.210 --> 03:12.190
You don't need to rush me.

03:10.950 --> 03:15.280
Naofumi-dono, I highly 
appreciate your offer, but...

03:12.730 --> 03:15.280
Mm, this is really good.

03:13.880 --> 03:17.090
Thanks! I was starving!

03:17.090 --> 03:18.760
Time to dig in!

03:18.760 --> 03:19.940
Here you go!

03:20.350 --> 03:24.850
Starving? Wasn't she just eating her own lunch?

03:24.850 --> 03:26.840
She was, yeah.

03:30.380 --> 03:32.370
The Seven Shadows, huh?

03:32.370 --> 03:39.350
My belief is that Shadow, their leader, 
is at the center of all the recent chaos.

03:38.060 --> 03:39.350
Subaru-kun, try some.

03:39.350 --> 03:40.420
Thanks!

03:39.350 --> 03:42.570
The Seven Shadows are a mysterious group.

03:40.420 --> 03:41.500
Here you go.

03:42.570 --> 03:51.620
All we know about them is that they serve 
some great lord called "Shadow," right?

03:51.620 --> 03:54.940
But they're all good people!

03:54.940 --> 03:59.050
They didn't seem like they 
were out to hurt us.

03:59.050 --> 04:03.280
Raphtalia, you were close
 to one of them, right?

04:03.280 --> 04:06.010
Alpha, their leader, yes.

04:06.010 --> 04:07.860
Shall I ask her?

04:07.860 --> 04:09.070
Would you?

04:09.070 --> 04:10.120
Sure.

04:10.120 --> 04:12.200
Naofumi-sama, please come with me.

04:12.200 --> 04:15.580
Sorry, I need to go to the 
janitor's office after this.

04:16.530 --> 04:19.030
Where Wilhelm and Sebas hang out?

04:19.030 --> 04:19.990
Yeah.

04:21.510 --> 04:24.740
Raphtalia, what's gotten you so down?

04:24.960 --> 04:27.990
You don't know how a girl feels.

04:29.890 --> 04:33.420
Then I'll go with Raphtalia-oneechan!

04:33.420 --> 04:35.520
Wait! Hey!

04:36.610 --> 04:38.960
Hey, don't grab me by the hair.

04:41.620 --> 04:44.590
Wait! I have to put my boots on!

04:47.020 --> 04:51.250
Um, CZ, what are you doing here?

04:51.250 --> 04:56.020
When something cute is present, it is 
inevitable that I will be present as well.

04:56.020 --> 04:58.040
I-I see.

04:58.040 --> 05:01.400
So... I've come to introduce myself properly.

05:01.400 --> 05:04.350
I am Tanya von Degurechaff.

05:05.070 --> 05:06.530
I'm Alpha.

05:06.530 --> 05:08.240
That's what they call me.

05:08.240 --> 05:11.710
Alpha-dono, let me just come out and ask.

05:12.020 --> 05:16.160
I'd like to ask you about Seven Shadows
 and the man called "Shadow."

05:18.270 --> 05:22.900
Shadow is beyond our ability 
to even imagine him.

05:23.230 --> 05:27.150
We are merely his arms and legs.

05:27.150 --> 05:28.980
Just his arms and legs?

05:28.980 --> 05:33.340
Yes. At the moment, we have 
no greater worth than that.

05:33.340 --> 05:34.820
As frustrating as it is to say.

05:36.570 --> 05:39.970
I kind of understand how you feel.

05:39.970 --> 05:43.480
I want to be Naofumi-sama's sword.

05:43.480 --> 05:46.490
But I'm not really used to being this way.

05:46.490 --> 05:49.100
You're fine, Raphtalia-oneechan!

05:49.100 --> 05:50.120
Filo!

05:50.450 --> 05:53.900
Yes. You're fine, Raphtalia.

05:53.900 --> 05:57.120
CZ, you don't mean that at all, do you?

05:57.120 --> 05:58.090
Correct.

05:59.610 --> 06:02.360
So you want more responsibility?

06:02.360 --> 06:05.690
You refuse to be just a cog in a machine?

06:05.690 --> 06:07.330
That's not a common...

06:07.330 --> 06:09.580
I don't want to just have him protect me!

06:10.830 --> 06:14.560
W-Well, everyone values different things.

06:14.980 --> 06:21.930
So Shadow fights the evil 
Cult of Diablos, correct?

06:21.930 --> 06:23.910
Yes. But...

06:23.910 --> 06:24.780
But?

06:26.330 --> 06:30.450
I don't know what he really thinks.

06:32.660 --> 06:36.970
Alpha-dono, thank you for sparing 
us some of your valuable time.

06:36.970 --> 06:41.350
I'm glad to have learned more 
about the school as well, Tanya.

06:41.710 --> 06:45.390
Okay, I'll be on my way.

06:45.770 --> 06:47.810
Oh, but one more thing...

06:47.810 --> 06:52.870
The boy in the back row, Cid Kagenou...

06:52.870 --> 06:54.600
Is he one of your comrades?

06:55.090 --> 06:56.160
Hm...

06:57.060 --> 07:01.320
No, Cid Kagenou is not one of our comrades.

07:01.940 --> 07:02.700
I see.

07:02.700 --> 07:04.150
Farewell, then.

07:07.150 --> 07:10.550
Hello! It's time for class!

07:10.550 --> 07:12.740
Yes, it sure is!

07:13.510 --> 07:15.030
Alpha-kun, my student,

07:15.030 --> 07:20.960
I'm so glad to see you getting along 
with students in the next class already!

07:20.960 --> 07:24.350
Yes. I'm glad to see they're 
people I can talk to.

07:24.350 --> 07:26.840
Yes, yes.

07:26.840 --> 07:32.780
Some call Tanya-kun "a devil wearing
 the skin of a little girl," but...

07:29.870 --> 07:32.180
"A devil wearing the skin of a little girl"?!

07:33.470 --> 07:36.260
Rerugen-sensei calls her that, specifically.

07:35.030 --> 07:38.430
A devil... wearing the skin of a little girl...

07:36.260 --> 07:41.020
He seems to have some special 
feelings towards her.

07:41.020 --> 07:44.190
Terror? Awe?

07:44.190 --> 07:48.310
She seems to me like a nice girl 
who gets along with my daddy.

07:45.940 --> 07:47.340
Diablos?!

07:48.310 --> 07:50.320
Yes, that's all she seems to me!

07:50.570 --> 07:51.830
I see!

07:51.830 --> 07:53.450
That's my Subaru!

07:53.790 --> 07:55.160
I'm blushing!

07:57.020 --> 07:58.940
Albedo-san! Emilia-san!

07:58.940 --> 07:59.940
Visha?

08:00.470 --> 08:02.380
What are you doing?

08:02.380 --> 08:09.130
Well, our morning glories got too big for 
their pots, so we're going to replant them.

08:09.130 --> 08:12.190
That's a lot bigger than 
they usually get, right?

08:12.190 --> 08:13.450
What are you talking about?

08:13.450 --> 08:16.310
Your team has bigger problems.

08:16.310 --> 08:17.140
Really?

08:18.050 --> 08:19.140
See?

08:18.900 --> 08:22.150
What the hell?

08:20.620 --> 08:23.110
Wh-Wh-What happened?

08:23.110 --> 08:26.850
I-I felt like I had to work
 really hard, so I did!

08:26.850 --> 08:27.770
Wonderful.

08:27.770 --> 08:28.960
Yes, wonderful.

08:28.960 --> 08:32.020
This goes too far, though!

08:32.020 --> 08:36.410
Come on, Weiss, lift 'er up!

08:37.850 --> 08:38.750
You can do it!

08:39.360 --> 08:41.430
Work harder, Weiss-san.

08:41.430 --> 08:43.770
Darkness is holding them up fine.

08:43.770 --> 08:50.090
The idea of comparing me 
to Darkness-san is crazy!

08:50.090 --> 08:52.590
Wait. Take that back!

08:50.370 --> 08:51.750
Come on, come on!

08:52.590 --> 08:54.230
You make it look easy, though.

08:54.230 --> 08:55.390
Well...

08:55.730 --> 08:57.750
Hey, you guys!

08:59.370 --> 09:03.430
Can I just use my magic to carry them all?

09:03.430 --> 09:05.680
Please do!

09:05.680 --> 09:06.770
He says no need to bother!

09:06.770 --> 09:08.790
Kazuma!

09:11.610 --> 09:13.700
Well, that should do it.

09:13.700 --> 09:15.620
Well done, Ains!

09:15.620 --> 09:19.120
You're an undead, but you still have my praise!

09:19.120 --> 09:23.100
Why is this woman always so arrogant?

09:23.100 --> 09:23.980
Agreed.

09:23.980 --> 09:24.940
Wait.

09:24.940 --> 09:27.000
Don't you always talk like that, Ram-san?

11:04.030 --> 11:05.500
There we go.

11:07.390 --> 11:12.150
Please rest in peace here, Pasta Zombies.

11:16.060 --> 11:17.240
Is that...

11:17.860 --> 11:23.260
Shadow, it's likely that Class 2 is 
controlled by the Cult of Diablos.

11:24.460 --> 11:29.380
Not only is there the ruler of darkness 
you spoke of, Ains Ooal Gown,

11:29.380 --> 11:33.180
but there's also a devil wearing the skin 
of a little girl, Tanya von Degurechaff.

11:33.180 --> 11:35.760
Class 2 has far too many suspicious people.

11:38.220 --> 11:40.110
The seeds are sown...

11:41.340 --> 11:44.920
the stem grows, 
and the flower blooms.

11:44.920 --> 11:47.820
Master, what does that mean?

11:47.820 --> 11:52.740
Does the flower bring a world of death, or life?

11:52.740 --> 11:54.990
Does that mean...

11:54.990 --> 11:58.780
We must prepare as well.

11:58.780 --> 12:01.320
We need to gather more information.

12:01.320 --> 12:02.800
There's no time.

12:03.110 --> 12:05.180
Everyone, do what we must.

12:05.180 --> 12:06.520
Right!

12:13.150 --> 12:17.370
Boss, what were they all talking about?

12:17.370 --> 12:18.470
Who knows?

12:19.230 --> 12:21.230
Delta, you don't need to 
think about it too much.

12:21.230 --> 12:24.520
Got it! I won't think about it too much!
